To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: How to copy vmcore file without expand it
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96075325906725

The system crash vmcore is a file in sparse (save space) format, the
following command must be use to copy it without to expand it:

	dd if=vmcore.0 of=vmcore.0.new conv=sparse bs=8k

