Use infocmp on the Sun to get the terminfo definition for "sun", then
use tic on the Alpha to install the new definition.  For example,

On the Sun:

    infocmp -I sun >sun.ti
    
    move sun.ti to the Alpha, and:
    
        tic sun.ti
	
